Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 14:19:46 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Retain Caddy Local Authority extra-CA for wss://buzz.mpzl

Keep rustls extra-CA trust wiring so Desktop and buzz-acp can
connect to the local buzz.mpzl relay behind Caddy Local Authority.

Signed-off-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
